        "pt": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "Genuine consent is freely given, informed, and revocable—without pressure, with understanding, and with the real option to say no or change your mind; anything less isn't true consent",
